4,"title":"Local government reorganisation: decision letter to Warwickshire council leaders","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a58d40060a6e36813cb42f6/Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_letter_to_Warwickshire_council_leaders.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a58d4435ca06bf11ccb42fa","filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_letter_to_Worcestershire_council_leaders.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":238545,"filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_letter_to_Worcestershire_council_leaders.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9434117","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Local government reorganisation: decision letter to Worcestershire council leaders","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a58d4435ca06bf11ccb42fa/Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_letter_to_Worcestershire_council_leaders.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 16 July 2026, the Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government, Steve Reed OBE MP, wrote to the leaders of councils in:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Derbyshire and Derby</li>\n  <li>Devon, Plymouth and Torbay</li>\n  <li>East Sussex and Brighton and Hove</li>\n  <li>Gloucestershire</li>\n  <li>Hertfordshire</li>\n  <li>Kent and Medway</li>\n  <li>Lancashire, Blackburn with Darwen and Blackpool</li>\n  <li>Leicestershire, Leicester and Rutland</li>\n  <li>Lincolnshire, North Lincolnshire and North East Lincolnshire</li>\n  <li>Nottinghamshire and Nottingham</li>\n  <li>Oxfordshire</li>\n  <li>Staffordshire and Stoke-on-Trent</li>\n  <li>Warwickshire</li>\n  <li>Worcestershire</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The letter informed them of his decision on which proposal for local government reorganisation would be implemented in their area.</p>\n\n<p>These letters were accompanied by 2 pieces of guidance:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-supporting-adult-social-care-public-health-and-childrens-services\">supporting adult social care, public health and children’s services</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-guidance-on-sector-support\">guidance on sector support</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Decision letter for Devon, Plymouth and Torbay updated to correct an error in the number of parishes listed under the remit of the new Torbay unitary authority. This does not change the decision made in that area. ","public_timestamp":"2026-08-04T10:48:58Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-16T14:45:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9434104","9434105","9434106","9434107","9434108","9434109","9434110","9434111","9434112","9434113","9434114","9434115","9434116","9434117"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-16T15:45:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-16T15:45:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-decision-letters-to-council-leaders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-decision-letters-to-council-leaders","base_path":"/gove